From 6c26df90c39a60ff99248dec3253f82ba17dd974 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Killy <308386066+killy-netsphere@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:48:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 013/211] cuda gather copy: one kernel per expert tensor moves
 all experts into the device copy

Cached experts come from the MoE cache banks, the rest from the pinned host weights through UVA. Used on twin splits
and on the pipelined upload-all path; replaces ~300 cudaMemcpyAsync per layer that back-pressured the host issue loop
(5-10 s of host time per 8K ubatch, measured with GGML_SCHED_TIMING).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
